  "id": "criteria-of-evaluation",
  "term": "criteria of evaluation",
  "definition": "Criteria of evaluation are verbalized, often abstract standards used in reflective processing to judge or interpret something. In this source, they are the basis for reflective emotions rather than the direct stimulus reactions seen in automatic emotions.",
